$DATUM Catalytic Asymmetric Synthesis of Quaternary Carbons Bearing Two Aryl
Substituents. Enantioselective Synthesis of 3-Alkyl-3-Aryl Oxindoles by
Catalytic Asymmetric Intramolecular Heck Reactions
