$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM 5-(2-Pyridyl)-5''-dodecyl-2,2':5',2''-terthiophene (HL3) A mixture of
2-(tributyltin)-5-dodecyl-thiophene (1.8 g, 3.4 mmol),
5-bromo-5'-(2-pyridyl)-2,2'-bithiophene (1.0 g, 3.1 mmol) and [Pd(PPh3)4]
(90 mg, 0.078 mmol) in DMF (30 ml) were stirred at 95°C for 18 h. The
crystals of the desired product that appeared upon cooling to room
temperature were filtered off and crystallised from DMF. Yield 85%.
5-(2-Pyridyl)-5''-dodecyl-2,2':5',2''-terthiophene (HL3), Yield 85%. 1H
NMR (270 MHz, CDCl3): δ 0.87 (t, 3H, J 6.7 Hz), 1.2-1.5 (m, 18H), 1.67
(m, 2H, J 6.7 Hz), 2.78 (t, 2H, J 6.7 Hz), 6.67 (d, 1H, J 3.7 Hz), 6.98
(d, 1H, J 3.7 Hz), 7.00 (d, 1H, J 3.7 Hz), 7.12 (m, 3H), 7.46 (d, 1H, J
3.7 Hz), 7.65 (m, 2H), 8.55 (ddd, 1H, J 5.6, 1.5, 1.1 Hz). Anal. calcd.
for C29H35NS3: C, 70.54; H, 7.14; N, 2.84. Found: C, 70.51; H, 7.30; N,
2.60.
