equiv) in DMSO (0.05 M concentration), and reactions were heated to 80-90
°C. Yields are provided for purified products following flash silica gel
chromatography. Reactant: 5-Iodo-2-(phenylsulfonyl)-1,3-oxazole (9);
Compound 20; Yield: 85 %.
