$DATUM 2,3,7,8-Tetra(3-(octyloxy)phenyl)-5,10-dithien-2-ylpyrazino[2,3-g]quinoxaline
(6) To a solution of tributylstannyl thiophene (1.45 g, 5 mmol) and 5
(2.31 g, 2 mmol) in dry THF (20 mL), bis(triphenylphosphine)palladium(II)
dichloride (Pd(PPh3)2Cl2) (28 mg, 0.04 mmol) was added under nitrogen.
The reaction mixture was refluxed for 20 h. After cooling down, the
mixture was transferred to a separatory funnel, extracted with diethyl
ether and then washed with water. The ether phase was dried over MgSO4.
The crude product was purified by silica-gel column chromatography with a
mixture of hexane:dichloromethane (1:1) as eluent to obtain 6 as a red
solid (1.98 g, 85%).
2,3,7,8-Tetra(3-(octyloxy)phenyl)-5,10-dithien-2-ylpyrazino[2,3-g]quinoxaline
(6), yield (1.98 g, 85%). 1H NMR (CDCl3) δ: 8.51 (s, 2H), 7.71 (d, J =
4.4 Hz, 2H), 7.52 (s, 4H), 7.40-7.28 (m, 6H), 7.24 (d, J = 7.9 Hz, 4H),
6.95 (d, J = 8.1 Hz, 4H), 3.95 (t, J = 6.4 Hz, 8H), 1.94-1.61 (m, 8H),
1.51-1.13 (m, 40H), 0.90 (t, J = 6.3 Hz, 12H). 13C NMR (CDCl3) δ: 159.24,
152.33, 139.77, 136.46, 134.58, 134.47, 130.23, 129.33, 128.37, 126.26,
122.95, 117.19, 115.46, 68.28, 32.01, 29.51, 29.46, 29.33, 26.23, 22.85,
14.29. MALDI-TOF MS (Mw = 1163.7): m/z = 1164.0 [M+].
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
