$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM A mixture of crude stannane 5, 1,3,5-tribromobenzene 6 (63 mg, 0.2 mmol),
and dry N,N-dimethylformamide (1.5 cm3) was degassed with argon for 10
min. Tetrakis(triphenylphosphine) palladium (0) (20 mg, 0.02 mmol) was
then added and the mixture heated at 90°C for 50 h. After being allowed
to cool, acetone (10 cm3) was added and the mixture filtered, followed by
washing of the solid with acetone until the filtrate was colorless. The
residue was then dried under a vacuum to give 7 (310 mg, 85%) as a brown
solid.
1,3,5-Tri(5'''',5'''''-dihexyl-[2',5'';2'',5''';2''',2'''';3''',2''''']pentathiophen-
5'-yl)benzene [3G1-2S] (7). yield (310 mg, 85%) mp 101°C. Found: C,
67.06; H, 6.02. C102H108S15 requires: C, 67.50; H, 6.00%. λmax
(CH2Cl2)/nm 252 (logε/dm3mol-1cm-1 4.53) and 423 (4.81). δH (400 MHz;
