$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: Procedure F (no glove box). Pd2(dba)3, CsF,
the aryl bromide, NMP, a solution of P(t-Bu)3 in NMP, and the organotin
reagent were added in turn to a 4-mL vial equipped with a stir bar. The
vial was capped with a rubber septum under an argon atmosphere and
allowed to stir at room temperature for the indicated amount of time. The
workup was the same as that for Procedure C. 2-Allyltoluene. Colorless
liquid. Yield: 111 mg (84%). 1H NMR (300 MHz, CDCl3): δ 7.16 (s, 4H),
5.91-6.04 (m, 1H), 4.98-5.11 (m, 2H), 3.38-3.41 (m, 2H), 2.32 (s, 3H).
